title: Stella by Starlight
key: Bb
tempo: 120
style: jazz

// Thirty-two bars, ABCD, nothing repeated. It opens on a half-diminished
// chord a tritone from home and is not in B-flat until the ninth bar; the
// two-fives are minor as often as major, and the last line falls in minor
// two-fives to the tonic.
[A]
| Em7b5 | A7b9 | Cm7    | F7  |
| Fm7   | Bb7  | Ebmaj7 | Ab7 |

[B]
| Bbmaj7 | Em7b5 A7 | Dm7   | Bbm7 Eb7 |
| Fmaj7  | Em7b5 A7 | Am7b5 | D7b9     |

[C]
| G7#5 | % | Cm7    | % |
| Ab7  | % | Bbmaj7 | % |

[D]
| Em7b5 | A7b9 | Dm7b5  | G7b9 |
| Cm7b5 | F7   | Bbmaj7 | %    |
